WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.182 --> 00:00:03.556
Isaac, I've been feeling, I've been feeling for you,

2
00:00:03.556 --> 00:00:06.178
because I've been thinking, it must be tough

3
00:00:06.178 --> 00:00:09.819
for your character now going through life without Hodor.

4
00:00:09.819 --> 00:00:11.387
Aww.
(audience awws)

5
00:00:11.387 --> 00:00:12.254
Yeah, no it's--

6
00:00:12.254 --> 00:00:13.463
You know, what's it, what's it been like for you?

7
00:00:13.463 --> 00:00:15.932
Well I've grown up next to Kristian Nairn,

8
00:00:15.932 --> 00:00:20.099
who's the actor who played Hodor for the past six years,

9
00:00:20.316 --> 00:00:23.027
and so, to suddenly not have that,

10
00:00:23.027 --> 00:00:27.194
literally big presence on the set has been really sad.

11
00:00:27.536 --> 00:00:30.318
I miss my big, friendly giant, but I'm sure he's--

12
00:00:30.318 --> 00:00:34.235
(audience cheers and applauds)

13
00:00:45.099 --> 00:00:49.266
He's back (laughing) he's back.

14
00:00:49.521 --> 00:00:51.658
[Conan] Wow. (laughing)

15
00:00:51.658 --> 00:00:55.825
[Crowd] Hodor, Hodor, Hodor, Hodor, Hodor, Hodor.

16
00:00:56.404 --> 00:00:59.895
[Conan] That was nice, I can't believe it.

17
00:00:59.895 --> 00:01:00.934
I can not believe it.

18
00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:01.767
Hello.

19
00:01:03.505 --> 00:01:04.566
I can not believe we just had

20
00:01:04.566 --> 00:01:06.977
a happy ending on Game of Thrones.

21
00:01:06.977 --> 00:01:08.727
(audience cheers and laughs)
First time,

22
00:01:08.727 --> 00:01:09.560
first time ever.

23
00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:10.393
It brings a tear to my eye,

24
00:01:10.393 --> 00:01:11.657
thank you so much for being here,

25
00:01:11.657 --> 00:01:12.509
what a lovely surprise.

26
00:01:12.509 --> 00:01:13.557
You're welcome man, you're welcome (laughs)

27
00:01:13.557 --> 00:01:17.724
Security here stinks.
(audience laughs)

